  "contract": [
    "Image uses synced NamedTempFile and persist_noclobber; name/font/media invoke a fallible ownership observer on synced private file before final persist.",
    "Observer or identity capture failure vetoes final publication and propagates through archive preparation. No owner commit admitted after failed preparation.",
    "Publication::created captures a live original inode before final publication; no conversion of identity capture failure into a weak ownership record.",
    "Metadata error removes only the image whose identity still matches the candidate, preserving a concurrently replaced image.",
    "Original non-scoped callers use successful no-op callbacks; explicit metadata rename keeps its existing replacement/CAS behavior."
  ],
